requestedQty: Quantity requested for transfer.



dispatchedQty: Quantity sent from the source plant.



receivedQty: Quantity received at the destination plant.



damagedQty: Quantity received in damaged condition.



shortageQty: Difference between dispatched and received quantities.



cancelledQty: Quantity cancelled from the transfer.



